@page "/privacy"
@layout MainLayout

<PageTitle>Privacy - Fellowship Analyzer</PageTitle>

<div class="privacy-page">
    <PageHeader Title="Privacy" />

    <section class="privacy-body">
        <h2>Privacy First: No Cookies or Ads</h2>
        <p>
            This site is cookie-free and ad-free. Your theme choices and recently viewed reports are
            saved locally on your device and vanish as soon as you clear your browser data.
        </p>

        <h2>What Our Servers See</h2>
        <p>
            Our server logs are kept securely for 90 days and only collect the bare minimum to make
            the site work:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Gameplay data:</strong> Hero, dungeon name, report code, player ID, and dungeon ID.</li>
            <li><strong>General location:</strong> Approximate city or country (your actual IP address is discarded immediately).</li>
            <li><strong>What we DON'T collect:</strong> Player names, email addresses, or account credentials. Nothing is ever linked to you as an individual visitor.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Questions?</h2>
        <p>
            Drop us a line by opening an issue on
            <a href="https://github.com/Seriousnes/FellowshipAnalyzer/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.
        </p>
    </section>
</div>
